en:
Dispatching #YCrafters#E for #YExploration#E and #Yproduction#E activities #Yconsumes#E their #YVigor#E;
Crafters with 0 Vigor #Ycannot work.#E Dispatch them to a #YResting Facility#E or enable #Yautomatic food consumption#E in the Shared Depot to restore their Vigor;
#YIdle#E Crafters will also slowly recover Vigor over time.

